{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1100,
   "y": -420,
   "width": 1100,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "# Ling-3.0-flash-VL — one decoder layer  \nLeft: **KDA** (35 layers). Right: **Gated MLA** (7 layers: L5, L11, L17, L23, L29, L35, L41). Both feed the same MoE FFN (L2–41). Shapes per token; parameter counts per layer from the checkpoint."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-bsrc",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 100,
   "y": -420,
   "width": 1000,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "Sources: tensor shapes from the safetensors headers of inclusionAI/Ling-3.0-flash-VL, hyper-parameters from its config.json, dataflow from inclusionAI/vllm-ling-v3 (bailing_moe_v3.py, bailing_moe_v3_vl.py); total / active counts from the model card (124B / 5.5B)."
  },
  {
   "id": "hin1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -102,
   "y": -220,
   "width": 205,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 170,
   "y": -230,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`h [T, 2560]  residual stream in`"
  },
  {
   "id": "n13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -150,
   "y": -166,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 76,
   "text": "**input RMSNorm**  \n2.6K",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-kda",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1040,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 40,
   "text": "**KDA** — linear attention (35 layers)"
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-mla",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 620,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 40,
   "text": "**Gated MLA** — softmax attention (7 layers)"
  },
  {
   "id": "kqkv4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -600,
   "y": 60,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 76,
   "text": "**q / k / v proj** 2560 → 3 × 4096  \n31.5M",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "kqkvt5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -614,
   "y": 176,
   "width": 328,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "kqkvt6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -614,
   "y": 190,
   "width": 328,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "kqkvt7",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -614,
   "y": 204,
   "width": 328,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl8",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1074,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`q, k, v [T, 4096]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "kconv9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -600,
   "y": 258,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 76,
   "text": "**short conv** (causal, k=4) + SiLU  \n49.2K",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "kheads10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -614,
   "y": 374,
   "width": 328,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "kheads11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -614,
   "y": 388,
   "width": 328,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "kheads12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -614,
   "y": 402,
   "width": 328,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1074,
   "y": 364,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`q, k, v [T, 32, 128]  (q, k L2-normed)`"
  },
  {
   "id": "kgate14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -600,
   "y": 456,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 76,
   "text": "**gates** β = σ(b_proj) [T, 32] ·  \ndecay α = f_proj → A_log, dt_bias, ≥ -5.0  \n10.6M",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "kdelta15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -600,
   "y": 572,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 76,
   "text": "**delta rule** S ← (I − βkkᵀ)·diag(α)·S + βkvᵀ  \nstate S [32, 128, 128], out o = Sᵀq",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "ko16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -614,
   "y": 688,
   "width": 328,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl17",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1074,
   "y": 678,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`o [T, 32, 128]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "kon18",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -600,
   "y": 742,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 76,
   "text": "**gated RMSNorm** norm(o) · σ(g_proj h)  \n10.5M",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "kop19",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -600,
   "y": 858,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 76,
   "text": "**o_proj** 4096 → 2560  \n10.5M",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "kout20",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -552,
   "y": 974,
   "width": 205,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
